# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/compression-header.md#magic-bytes
# provenance: PV-0060, PV-0061, PV-0062, PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066, PV-0067
# kind: compression-header
# description: Magic bytes in the wrong order (9D 1F).
# derivation: Byte 5 must be 1F and byte 6 9D (PV-0067); swapped, IMPL-CH-2 gives bad-magic. Length, algorithm byte (LZH) and byte 7 are valid.
# expect.error: bad-magic
hex:
02 01 00 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
12                                                # algorithm byte
9D 1F                                             # magic
02                                                # byte 7
